('0801621001', '0801621', 'ED Phoebe dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Dark', 'Woven Tops', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Blouses', 'V-neck nursing dress in a softly draping jacquard weave with a unique nursing feature, decorative gathers at the shoulders and long sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Top layer with covered buttons and ties at the waist. The design includes a double layer to help retain warmth while allowing easier nursing access.', NULL, 0, 0),
