('0803255001', '0803255', 'Oz skinny fit crop foldup trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Other structure', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Ankle-length suit trousers in woven fabric with a zip fly, hook-and-eye fastener and concealed button. Side pockets, welt back pockets and legs with creases and sewn-in turn-ups at the hems. Skinny Fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0803255005', '0803255', 'Oz skinny fit crop foldup trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Check', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Dark', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Ankle-length suit trousers in woven fabric with a zip fly, hook-and-eye fastener and concealed button. Side pockets, welt back pockets and legs with creases and sewn-in turn-ups at the hems. Skinny Fit – a fit with slightly shorter legs that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0803256001', '0803256', 'Oz 1B skinny fi blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in a stretch weave with narrow notch lapels. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and one inner pocket. One button at the front, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Skinny Fit – a slightly shorter style that shapes in at the chest and tapers sharply at the waist. This combined with narrow shoulders and sleeves creates a completely fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
