('0807316001', '0807316', 'Saasha dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Light Orange', 'Dusty Light', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Long dress in softly draping satin in a relaxed fit with a deep V-neck front and back. Wrapover top with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener at the neckline and narrow ties at the back of the neck. Long sleeves with gathers at the top and volume at the bottom, and narrow, buttoned cuffs. Gathered seam at the waist and a softly draping skirt. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
