('0807322001', '0807322', 'Quincy bag', 'Bag', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Light Pink', 'Dusty Light', 'Young Girl Big Acc', 'Children Accessories, Swimwear', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Accessories', 'Small shoulder bag in imitation leather with a zip at the top, a quilted front with studs and a shoulder strap with a press-stud at one end. Lined. Size 5x11x16 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
