('0807329002', '0807329', 'Scorpio', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Green', 'Dark', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Dress in matt satin with a tie belt and deep V-neck with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener. Sewn-in wrapover front, seam at the waist and flared skirt with a wide flounce. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
