('0807362002', '0807362', 'JAVA trs', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Mixed solid/pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Ladies Sport Woven', 'Sport', 'Sport', 'Ladies H&M Sport', 'Unknown', 'Trousers geared to outdoor activity with good air permeability to wick away moisture. The trousers are made from a stretchy woven fabric for increased mobility, with a water-repellent finish on the bum and knees. Elasticated waist for added comfort, a zip fly and button, side pockets and a diagonal, zipped leg pocket for safe storage of valuables. Reinforced, wear-resistant hems with adjustable fasteners. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
