('0807376001', '0807376', 'Valencia maxi dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Ankle-length dress in woven fabric with inset lace trims, elasticated shoulder straps and wide flounces over the shoulders. Concealed zip and a button at one side and a flared skirt. Lined at the top and a short underskirt.', NULL, 0, 0),
