('0807716001', '0807716', 'CE Atomic dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Calf-length dress in sturdy brocade made from recycled polyester containing glittery threads. Draping over the bust with a large, decorative bow, a seam under the bust and a high, close-fitting waist with pleats for added volume. Concealed zip in one side. Shaped, sturdy skirt with concealed pockets in the side seams. Silicone trim at the top of the dress for best fit and detachable, adjustable shoulder straps. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807717001', '0807717', 'CE Septogram dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Dress in an airy jacquard weave made from recycled polyester. Deep V-neck with covered buttons, an asymmetric seam with a grosgrain trim at the waist, and a concealed zip in one side made from recycled polyester. Long trumpet sleeves with decorative seams at the cuffs. Skirt in several flounced tiers with an asymmetric hem. Shorter at the front. Bodice and skirt lined with recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807718001', '0807718', 'Toro chambray skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Chambray', 'Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Kids Girl Dresses', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Girl', 'Dresses/Skirts girls', 'Skirt in soft cotton chambray with adjustable elastication at the back of the waist, discreet side pockets and buttons down the front with two decorative buttons at the hem. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807719001', '0807719', 'CE Faith dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Pink', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Dress in woven fabric made from recycled polyester with a deep V-neck, shaped cups and narrow shoulder straps that are adjustable at the back. Decorative appliqué made from recycled glass beads and sparkly stones made from recycled acrylic. Seam under the bust and at the waist. Flared, voluminous skirt in several tiers of pleated tulle. Concealed zip at the back. Lining and zip made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807721001', '0807721', 'CE Healing dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Pink', 'Bright', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Dress in airy organic silk with a V-neck front and back, pleats on the shoulders and gathers down the sleeves. Concealed zip at the back made partly from recycled polyester. Closer fit at the top, a tapered waist with an asymmetric, gathered seam, and a wide, softly draping, circular skirt with a slit at the front. Slightly longer at the back. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807722001', '0807722', 'CE Mystery dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Straight-cut dress in an airy jacquard weave made from recycled polyester. Draping at the front and a seam at the waist. Balloon sleeves and a long opening at the back with a button at the back of the neck. Skirt with draped details and a short slit at the front. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807723001', '0807723', 'CE Buffy dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Sequin', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Straight-cut, loose-fitting dress in a sequined weave made from recycled polyester. V-neck and wide shoulder straps decorated with ties that can be fastened into bows. Concealed zip in one side made partly from recycled polyester. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807724001', '0807724', 'CE Rituals dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Short dress in woven fabric made from recycled polyester with a deep V-neck, shaped cups and narrow, adjustable shoulder straps. Seam under the bust and at the waist. Flared skirt in several pleated tiers. Concealed zip at the back made partly from recycled polyester. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807725001', '0807725', 'CE Serpent dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Short dress in airy chiffon made from recycled polyester with a deep, pleated V-neck. Long sleeves with gathers and a covered button at the cuffs. Close-fitting at the top, a tapered waist with an asymmetric seam, and a gently draping skirt with a wide flounce at the hem. Concealed zip in one side made partly from recycled polyester. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807727002', '0807727', 'CE Infinity coat', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Greyish Beige', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Coat in faux fur made partly from recycled polyester. Concealed fastening with sturdy hooks and eyes at the front, concealed pockets in the side seams and a tie belt at the waist in imitation leather made from water-based polyurethane. Lining made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807730002', '0807730', 'CE Fedder cape', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Embroidery', 'Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Short cape in beaded mesh made from recycled polyester with shoulder pads for defined shoulders and decorative beaded fringes. Decorative sparkly stone and bead appliqués made from recycled materials. Concealed hook-and-eye fastening at the top. Can also be fastened with ties under the arms.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807731001', '0807731', 'CE Fortune trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Ankle-length trousers in a sturdy weave made from Tencel™ lyocell and recycled polyester. High waist, concealed hook-and-eye fastening and zip fly. Closer fit at the top and shaped, tapered legs with creases. Diagonal side pockets and a welt back pocket.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807732001', '0807732', 'CE Vibrant Trousers', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Wide trousers in velvet made from recycled polyester. Close-fitting at the top with a high waist and button inside the waistband. Zip fly made partly from recycled polyester. Side pockets, and full-length legs with pleats for width and movement.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807733001', '0807733', 'CE Spiral skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Short, fitted skirt in velvet made from recycled polyester with draping, a concealed zip in one side made partly from recycled polyester and a wide, slightly asymmetric flounce at the hem. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807734001', '0807734', 'CE Runaway skirt', 'Skirt', 'Garment Lower body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Pink', 'Bright', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Fitted ball skirt in sturdy brocade made from recycled polyester containing glittery threads. High, close-fitting waist with pleats for volume and concealed pockets in the side seams. Recycled polyester lining.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807735001', '0807735', 'CE Lunar top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Cropped top in soft velvet made from recycled polyester with a V-shaped opening at the front and shoulders decorated with large, voluminous, sturdy flounces for a dramatic silhouette. Concealed zip in one side. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807736001', '0807736', 'CE Suspiria top', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Sequin', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Short, fitted top in recycled, sequined polyester chiffon with a harlequin pattern. Short, wide puff sleeves and a concealed zip at the back. Lined. The sequins and zip are made from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807737001', '0807737', 'CE Favourite blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Off White', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Airy blouse made from a Tencel™ lyocell and organic silk jacquard weave. Pointed, turn-down grandad collar with ties at the top, and concealed buttons down the front with a frilled button band. Frill around the shoulders, long trumpet sleeves and a rounded hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807738001', '0807738', 'CE Harlekin blouse', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Beige', 'Dusty Light', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Straight-cut blouse in airy chiffon made from recycled polyester with a contrasting colour collar with ties and a deep V-neck with covered buttons. Large, pleated flounces with overlocked edges over the shoulders and at the cuffs and hem. Wide balloon sleeves with asymmetric cuffs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807739001', '0807739', 'CE Ellipse top', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Pink', 'Bright', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Airy blouse in a Tencel™ lyocell and silk weave with a deep V-neck with pleats at the top and covered buttons down the front. Puff sleeves with lightly tulle-padded shoulders for a more defined silhouette. Tapered waist with a seam and flared peplum, and gathers at the back.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807740001', '0807740', 'CE Magic knitted dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Dress in a sturdy jacquard knit made from a recycled polyester blend containing glittery threads. Round neckline and shoulder pads for defined shoulders. Concealed zip at the back made partly from recycled polyester.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807741001', '0807741', 'CE Reflection knitted top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Jumper in an airy, fine-knit Tencel™ lyocell and wool blend with a turtle neck at the front and a V-shaped opening with wide ties at the back. Roll edges at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807741002', '0807741', 'CE Reflection knitted top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellowish Brown', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Jumper in an airy, fine-knit Tencel™ lyocell and wool blend with a turtle neck at the front and a V-shaped opening with wide ties at the back. Roll edges at the cuffs and hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807742001', '0807742', 'CE Hologram knit', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Beige', 'Medium Dusty', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Jumper in a soft knit made from recycled wool with a hole pattern. Gently dropped shoulders, wide sleeves that taper to the cuffs, and a gently tapered waist with a flared peplum.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0807743001', '0807743', 'CE Ray jacquard knitted top', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Jacquard', 'Dark Red', 'Dark', 'Conscious Exclusive', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Special Collections', 'Special Offers', 'Top in an airy knit made from a Tencel™ lyocell blend containing some wool. Round neckline and slightly longer sleeves.', NULL, 0, 0),
