('0815851001', '0815851', 'James Biker', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Outwear', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Jackets', 'Outdoor', 'Biker jacket in imitation leather with a diagonal zip down the front and notch lapels with decorative metal studs. Zipped front pockets and a zip at the cuffs. Lined. The jacket is PETA Approved Vegan-certified and meets PETA’s requirements for vegan products. This certification guarantees that the product is entirely free from materials and substances of animal origin.', NULL, 0, 0),
