('0816814001', '0816814', 'TC - LAUNDRYBAG MICROPLASTIC', 'Washing bag', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'GUPPYFRIEND laundry bag is designed to capture microplastics from synthetic garments in your machine wash. These plastics would otherwise enter rivers, lakes and oceans, but instead are captured inside the bag. Put your laundry inside the bag and wash as normal. Size 50x74 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
