('0816846001', '0816846', 'TC - sewing kit', 'Sewing kit', 'Garment and Shoe care', 'Solid', 'White', 'Light', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'This practical sewing kit contains everything you need to mend your favourite items. Your clothes will thank you! The kit contains a pair of scissors, a tape measure, a seam ripper, 4 needles, 10 pins, 10 safety pins, 4 white plastic buttons, 4 black plastic buttons, 5 metres of white thread and 5 metres of black thread.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0816852001', '0816852', 'TC - DETERGENT WHITE', 'Side table', 'Furniture', 'Transparent', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Concentrated, scented machine and hand wash laundry liquid for bright white results even at low temperatures. Designed to magic away stains too with the help of enzymes. For all types of laundry (30-90°C). Select 30°C to save energy (your laundry will be just as clean). Free from phosphates, zeolites and bleach. Made in a climate-neutral factory in Vadstena, Sweden. 9 washes (medium water). 500 ml. For contents and further information see www.hm.com/takecare.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0816857001', '0816857', 'TC NEW STAIN REMOVER', 'Side table', 'Furniture', 'Transparent', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Spot off! Grease and dirt live in constant fear of this gentle but effective stain remover. Spray onto the stain before washing. Concentrated formula – a little goes a long way. 300 ml. For contents and further information, see www.hm.com/takecare.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0816862001', '0816862', 'TC - DETERGENT DELICATE', 'Side table', 'Furniture', 'Transparent', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Take care', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Collaborations', 'Unknown', 'Concentrated, scented machine and hand wash laundry liquid to give your favourite items in silk, wool and other delicate materials the treatment they deserve. Free from phosphates, zeolites and bleach. Made in a climate-neutral factory in Vadstena, Sweden. 14 washes (medium water). 500 ml. For contents and further information see www.hm.com/takecare.', NULL, 0, 0),
