('0819207001', '0819207', 'Flirty Bambi stud pk', 'Earring', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Gold', 'Bright', 'Jewellery Extended', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Earrings in various sizes and designs. 21 pairs of small studs, two pairs of hoop earrings and two pairs with marbled pendants. Size from 0.2 cm to 3 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
