('0825168001', '0825168', 'Brune patch dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Light Blue', 'Light', 'Kids Girl Dresses', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Girl', 'Dresses/Skirts girls', 'Sleeveless, A-line dress in an airy, patterned cotton weave with narrow shoulder straps, elastication at the top of the back and gathered tiers to create width. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0825169001', '0825169', 'Marina Dress LS', 'Top', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Pink', 'Medium Dusty', 'Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Dresses Ladies', 'Calf-length dress in softly draping satin with a concealed zip at the back and a wrapover V-neck at the front with a concealed hook-and-eye fastener. Long raglan sleeves and wide cuffs with covered buttons. Seam at the waist and a skirt with pleats at the top to create soft draping. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
