('0826689002', '0826689', 'TMALL functional down jkt', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Yellow', 'Medium', 'Local relevance', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Project', 'Unknown', 'Straight-cut jacket in woven fabric with a filling of 70% down and 30% feathers. Lined, detachable hood with press-studs at the front and a detachable faux fur trim. Stand-up collar, zip and wind flap with press-studs down the front, two zipped chest pockets, two flap patch pockets with a press-stud, a zipped sleeve pocket and an inner pocket. Adjustable tab and inner ribbing at the cuffs and a concealed elastic drawstring at the hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
