('0831417001', '0831417', 'ED Rio dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Woven top', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'H&M+', 'Blouses', 'Short, wide dress in airy, crinkled chiffon with a small frilled collar and an opening with ties at the top. Long raglan balloon sleeves with buttoned cuffs, a gathered seam at the waist and a skirt with seams. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
