('0835961001', '0835961', 'MIST 2-p cardigan', 'Cardigan', 'Garment Upper body', 'Stripe', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Cardigans in soft, lightweight sweatshirt fabric made from a cotton blend with press-studs down the front and long raglan sleeves. The cotton content of the cardigans is organic.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0835962001', '0835962', 'SIMON L/L romper set', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Grey', 'Dark', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Dungarees and a short-sleeved top in soft, organic cotton. Dungarees in woven fabric with buttons at the sides, straps with adjustable buttoning, a chest pocket and concealed press-studs at the crotch and down the legs.Covered elastication at the back of the waist and around the hems. Top in jersey with a press-stud on the shoulders and short sleeves with sewn-in turn-ups.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0835962002', '0835962', 'SIMON L/L romper set', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Dungarees and a short-sleeved top in soft, organic cotton. Dungarees in woven fabric with buttons at the sides, straps with adjustable buttoning, a chest pocket and concealed press-studs at the crotch and down the legs.Covered elastication at the back of the waist and around the hems. Top in jersey with a press-stud on the shoulders and short sleeves with sewn-in turn-ups.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0835973001', '0835973', 'ALGOT giftset', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set in soft, organic cotton jersey. Three short-sleeved bodysuits with a wrapover front and press-studs down the sides and at the crotch. One romper suit with short sleeves, short legs and off-centre press-studs down the front and along one leg. Two pairs of trousers with wide, foldover ribbing at the waist. One hat with a sewn-in turn-up at the hem and one pair of scratch mittens with ribbed cuffs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0835978001', '0835978', 'REESE woven romper', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Medium Dusty', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. Sleeveless romper suit in soft, double-weave organic cotton with short, narrow shoulder straps and a button placket. Concealed press-studs at the crotch and down the legs (except in sizes 1½-4Y), and covered elastication at the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0835981001', '0835981', 'MC Eden dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Other structure', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Jersey', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Full-length, sleeveless dress in pleated jersey with a slight sheen. Round neckline and an opening with a decorative metal tube bead at the back of the neck. Narrow elasticated seam and detachable tie belt at the waist, and a raw-edge hem.', NULL, 0, 0),
