('0837278002', '0837278', 'Spanx Alot Shape Swimsuit NEW', 'Swimsuit', 'Swimwear', 'All over pattern', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Swimwear', 'Lingeries/Tights', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Swimwear, beachwear', 'Swimwear', 'Fully lined swimsuit with a sculpting effect on the tummy, back and bum. Narrow, adjustable shoulder straps, a wrapover top, padded cups that shape the bust and provide good support, gathers at the sides for a draped effect and side support.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0837283001', '0837283', 'Canyon jumpsuit', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Trousers', 'Ankle-length jumpsuit in a viscose and cotton weave with a grandad collar, buttons down the front to the waist, a yoke with a pleat at the back and open chest pockets. Gently dropped shoulders, short sleeves with a tab and D-rings, and a seam at the waist with elastication at the sides and detachable tie belt. Diagonal side pockets, a zip fly and concealed hook-and-eye fastener and tapered legs with sewn-in turn-ups at the hems. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0837285001', '0837285', 'Robyn denim jumpsuit', 'Jumpsuit/Playsuit', 'Garment Full body', 'Denim', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Trouser', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Everyday Collection', 'Trousers', 'Ankle-length jumpsuit in lightweight, washed cotton denim with a collar, concealed buttons down the front and a yoke with a pleat at the back. Flap chest pockets, diagonal side pockets and long sleeves with buttoned cuffs. Seam at the waist with a detachable tie belt, pleats at the front and shaping darts at the back. Zip fly and button and wide, gently tapered legs.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0837290001', '0837290', 'Flirty Rosie earring', 'Earring', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Jewellery Extended', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Small accessories', 'Accessories', 'Large plastic earrings with flower-shaped sequin and bead decorations. Length 9.5 cm.', NULL, 0, 0);
