('0839426001', '0839426', 'Baklava deluxe dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Jacquard', 'Orange', 'Medium Dusty', 'Blouse & Dress', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Trend', 'Blouses', 'Short dress in an airy jacquard weave with a high collar. Opening at the back with concealed buttons at the back of the neck and a concealed zip below. Long, gathered puff sleeves, a seam at the waist and a flared skirt. Underdress with adjustable shoulder straps.', NULL, 0, 0),
